{"seq":3,"slug":"food-webs-networks","title":"食物网与生态网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ecology/community-ecology/food-webs-networks","wordCount":2519,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"食物网与生态网络\">食物网与生态网络</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>食物网（Food Web）是群落中所有消费-资源关系的网络化表示，将能量流动与物种互作统一在图论框架下分析。核心概念包括：网络拓扑参数（连接度、链接密度、模块化）、May 悖论与弱相互作用稳定机制、关键种与营养级联的不对称影响、嵌套性与模块化对网络鲁棒性的贡献，以及生物多样性丧失的级联灭绝动态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从食物链到食物网\">从食物链到食物网</h2><p>自然群落中的营养关系远非线性食物链所能描绘。食物网（Food Web）是一个生态系统中所有消费-资源关系的网络表示。Elton（1927）率先系统描绘了北极食物网，此后食物网研究成为群落生态学的核心议题。</p>\n<p>食物网研究回答的核心问题是：群落中物种如何通过营养联系组织在一起？什么样的网络结构是稳定的？关键物种的丧失会引发怎样的级联效应？这些问题将 <a href=\"../foundations/energy-flow-trophic-levels\">能量流动</a> 的物理过程与群落层面的物种共存机制联系起来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"食物网的拓扑结构\">食物网的拓扑结构</h2><h3 id=\"基本网络参数\">基本网络参数</h3><p>描述食物网结构的核心指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>物种数（S）</td>\n<td>网络中的节点数</td>\n<td>20-200</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链接数（L）</td>\n<td>已实现的营养联系数</td>\n<td>通常 L/S ≈ 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接度（C）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = L/S^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，已实现联系/可能联系</td>\n<td>0.03-0.30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链接密度（L/S）</td>\n<td>平均每物种的联系数</td>\n<td>1.5-4.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>杂食性比例</td>\n<td>跨营养级取食的物种比例</td>\n<td>0.2-0.8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>食物链长度</td>\n<td>从基础物种到顶级捕食者的平均步数</td>\n<td>2-5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"营养位置\">营养位置</h3><p>物种在食物网中的位置可以精确量化为其营养级位置（Trophic Position）。与离散营养级不同，连续营养位置反映了杂食性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TP_i = 1 + \\sum_j (DC_{ij} \\times TP_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DC_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是物种 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 食物来源中来自物种 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的比例。例如，同时食草食肉的杂食动物的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 可能为 2.5。</p>\n<h3 id=\"食物网模式\">食物网模式</h3><p>大量经验食物网表现出若干一致的结构模式：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  subgraph 食物网典型结构模式&#10;    A[顶级捕食者&lt;br/&gt;少数物种, 高营养级] --&gt; B[中间消费者&lt;br/&gt;大多数物种, 中等营养级]&#10;    B --&gt; C[基底物种&lt;br/&gt;生产者/碎屑]&#10;    A --&gt; C&#10;  end&#10;  D[恒定连接度假说&lt;br/&gt;C ≈ 恒定] --- E[尺度不变假说&lt;br/&gt;L/S ≈ 恒定]&#10;  E --- F[小世界特征&lt;br/&gt;短平均路径长度]\">graph TD\n  subgraph 食物网典型结构模式\n    A[顶级捕食者&lt;br/&gt;少数物种, 高营养级] --&gt; B[中间消费者&lt;br/&gt;大多数物种, 中等营养级]\n    B --&gt; C[基底物种&lt;br/&gt;生产者/碎屑]\n    A --&gt; C\n  end\n  D[恒定连接度假说&lt;br/&gt;C ≈ 恒定] --- E[尺度不变假说&lt;br/&gt;L/S ≈ 恒定]\n  E --- F[小世界特征&lt;br/&gt;短平均路径长度]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>恒定连接度假说</strong>：不同大小食物网的连接度趋于恒定（约 0.10-0.15）</li>\n<li><strong>尺度不变假说</strong>：链接密度 L/S 在不同食物网间近似恒定（约 2）</li>\n<li><strong>小世界特征</strong>：任意两物种间的平均路径长度短</li>\n<li><strong>模块化结构</strong>：物种聚集为内部联系紧密、外部联系松散的模块</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"食物网动态模型\">食物网动态模型</h2><h3 id=\"lotka-volterra-系统\">Lotka-Volterra 系统</h3><p>经典的多物种 Lotka-Volterra 方程描述了食物网中物种间的动态耦合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dN_i}{dt} = N_i \\left(r_i + \\sum_j \\alpha_{ij} N_j\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为物种 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 对物种 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的种间作用系数（正=互利/被食，负=竞争/捕食）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"多样性-稳定性争论\">多样性-稳定性争论</h3><p>May（1972）的开创性工作表明：在随机构建的食物网中，物种数 S、连接度 C 和平均作用强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 满足以下条件时系统趋于不稳定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>α</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{SC} \\cdot \\bar{\\alpha} &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.0645em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9755em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0645em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6069em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一结论意味着——更大、更复杂的食物网反而更脆弱。然而自然界的观察恰恰相反：复杂食物网确实存在且持续运作。解决这一&quot;May悖论&quot;需要考虑自然食物网的<strong>非随机结构</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>弱相互作用占主导（大多数链接强度很弱）</li>\n<li>模块化结构限制了扰动传播</li>\n<li>负反馈循环提供自稳定机制</li>\n<li>适应性行为（如觅食切换）增强韧性</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"作用强度分布\">作用强度分布</h3><p>McCann（2000）提出&quot;弱作用稳定&quot;假说：食物网中大量的弱相互作用对稳定至关重要。经验证据支持作用强度呈高度偏斜分布——少数强联系嵌入大量弱联系的基质中。弱联系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>抑制消费者的振荡</li>\n<li>缓冲优势-被食互作的极端波动</li>\n<li>为能量流动提供替代通路</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"关键种与营养级联\">关键种与营养级联</h2><h3 id=\"关键种概念\">关键种概念</h3><p>关键种（Keystone Species）是指对群落结构的影响远超其生物量或多度所预期的物种（Paine 1969）。Paine 在潮间带移除海星（Pisaster ochraceus）的经典实验表明：单一捕食者的移除导致群落从 15 种减至 8 种——贻贝竞争垄断了空间。</p>\n<p>关键种类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>关键捕食者</td>\n<td>抑制竞争优势种</td>\n<td>潮间带海星</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态系统工程师</td>\n<td>创造/维持栖息地</td>\n<td>海狸筑坝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共生关键种</td>\n<td>提供关键传粉/传播</td>\n<td>榕-榕小蜂互利</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源关键种</td>\n<td>关键期提供食物</td>\n<td>干旱期的无花果树</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"营养级联\">营养级联</h3><p>营养级联（Trophic Cascade）指顶级捕食者的效应沿食物链向下逐级交替传递：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>顶级捕食者</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">−</mo></mpadded></mover><mtext>中间消费者</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></mpadded></mover><mtext>初级消费者</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">−</mo></mpadded></mover><mtext>生产者</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{顶级捕食者} \\xrightarrow{-} \\text{中间消费者} \\xrightarrow{+} \\text{初级消费者} \\xrightarrow{-} \\text{生产者}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0413em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">顶级捕食者</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0303em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0413em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">中间消费者</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0303em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0413em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">初级消费者</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0303em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">生产者</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>经典案例——黄石公园狼重引入（1995）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>狼捕食/恐吓麋鹿 → 麋鹿改变觅食行为</li>\n<li>河岸柳、杨树恢复 → 河岸稳定性增加</li>\n<li>河流形态改变 → 鱼类栖息地改善</li>\n<li>海狸种群恢复 → 进一步改变水文</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这种从顶级捕食者到物理环境的间接效应链被称为&quot;恐惧的生态学&quot;（Ecology of Fear）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生态网络的扩展\">生态网络的扩展</h2><h3 id=\"超越营养关系\">超越营养关系</h3><p>现代生态网络研究已超越单纯的食物网，扩展到多种互作类型：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[生态网络类型] --&gt; B[食物网&lt;br/&gt;消费-资源]&#10;  A --&gt; C[传粉网络&lt;br/&gt;植物-传粉者]&#10;  A --&gt; D[种子散布网络&lt;br/&gt;植物-散布者]&#10;  A --&gt; E[寄生网络&lt;br/&gt;宿主-寄生者]&#10;  A --&gt; F[多层网络&lt;br/&gt;多种互作叠加]&#10;  B --&gt; G[定向网络, 能量流]&#10;  C --&gt; H[双模网络, 互利]&#10;  E --&gt; I[定向网络, 拮抗]&#10;  F --&gt; J[全面描绘群落互作]\">graph TD\n  A[生态网络类型] --&gt; B[食物网&lt;br/&gt;消费-资源]\n  A --&gt; C[传粉网络&lt;br/&gt;植物-传粉者]\n  A --&gt; D[种子散布网络&lt;br/&gt;植物-散布者]\n  A --&gt; E[寄生网络&lt;br/&gt;宿主-寄生者]\n  A --&gt; F[多层网络&lt;br/&gt;多种互作叠加]\n  B --&gt; G[定向网络, 能量流]\n  C --&gt; H[双模网络, 互利]\n  E --&gt; I[定向网络, 拮抗]\n  F --&gt; J[全面描绘群落互作]</pre><h3 id=\"网络分析方法\">网络分析方法</h3><p>分析生态网络借鉴了 <a href=\"../../../../mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/\">图论</a> 和复杂网络科学的工具：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>网络指标</th>\n<th>生态含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>度分布（Degree Distribution）</td>\n<td>物种专化/泛化程度的分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚类系数（Clustering）</td>\n<td>共有食物来源的物种是否也互为食物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模块度（Modularity）</td>\n<td>物种是否聚为内紧外松的功能模块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌套性（Nestedness）</td>\n<td>泛化种的互作伙伴是否包含专化种的子集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中心度（Centrality）</td>\n<td>哪些物种在网络中最&quot;重要&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>鲁棒性（Robustness）</td>\n<td>移除物种后网络连通性的保持程度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"嵌套性与模块化\">嵌套性与模块化</h3><p>传粉网络和种子散布网络通常具有高度嵌套（Nested）结构：专化种只与泛化种互作，泛化种之间互相联系。这种结构意味着：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对随机灭绝具有高鲁棒性（专化种先灭绝，但泛化种冗余保持网络连通）</li>\n<li>对定向攻击（删除最泛化种）极脆弱</li>\n<li>促进物种共存（减少竞争排斥）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>食物网则更倾向于模块化（Modular）结构——物种聚为亚群，内部联系紧密。这限制了扰动在网络中的传播范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"食物网与生态系统功能\">食物网与生态系统功能</h2><h3 id=\"多营养级视角\">多营养级视角</h3><p>传统生态系统生态学关注能量和物质的总量流动，食物网视角则揭示流动的路径和调控：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>绿色通路</strong> vs <strong>褐色通路</strong>：牧食食物链与碎屑食物链的相对强度</li>\n<li><strong>营养上行</strong>（Bottom-up）vs <strong>营养下行</strong>（Top-down）：控制力的方向</li>\n<li><strong>生态化学计量</strong>：C:N:P 比值如何沿食物网变化，约束能量传递效率</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"生物多样性丧失的级联效应\">生物多样性丧失的级联效应</h3><p>物种灭绝在食物网中的传播遵循特定规律：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>次级灭绝</strong>：某物种灭绝导致依赖它的物种跟着消失</li>\n<li><strong>灭绝级联</strong>：次级灭绝引发进一步灭绝的连锁反应</li>\n<li><strong>功能冗余假说</strong>：功能相似的物种可互相替代，缓冲灭绝效应</li>\n<li><strong>互补效应</strong>：功能不同的物种各自贡献，总功能依赖多样性</li>\n</ul>\n<p>模拟研究表明：从食物网顶端移除物种（&quot;从上方拆解&quot;）比从底部移除更快导致网络崩溃——这对 <a href=\"../applied-ecology/conservation-biology\">保护生物学</a> 中优先保护大型捕食者提供了网络层面的理论依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"食物网的构建与验证\">食物网的构建与验证</h2><h3 id=\"数据来源\">数据来源</h3><p>构建食物网需要确定物种间&quot;谁吃谁&quot;，方法包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>胃含物/粪便分析</strong>：直接证据，但时间快照</li>\n<li><strong>稳定同位素分析</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>δ</mi><mn>15</mn></msup><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta^{15}N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 指示营养位置，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>δ</mi><mn>13</mn></msup><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta^{13}C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">13</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 指示碳源</li>\n<li><strong>DNA 条形码/宏条形码</strong>：从粪便或肠道提取 DNA 鉴定食物</li>\n<li><strong>直接观察</strong>：行为观察取食事件</li>\n<li><strong>文献综合</strong>：汇编已知互作关系</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"食物网模型\">食物网模型</h3><p>预测性食物网模型试图从简单规则重现经验食物网的结构：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>核心假设</th>\n<th>预测能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>随机模型</td>\n<td>链接随机分配</td>\n<td>差（基线参照）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>级联模型</td>\n<td>物种按大小排列，只能食更小者</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利基模型（Niche Model）</td>\n<td>物种在利基轴上占据连续食物范围</td>\n<td>较好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异速模型（Allometric）</td>\n<td>体型比决定取食关系</td>\n<td>好（尤其海洋系统）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Williams &amp; Martinez（2000）的利基模型仅用三个参数（S、C、利基宽度分布）就能重现经验食物网的大多数结构特征。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>食物网与生态网络研究将群落生态学从物种清单推进到物种间关系的系统分析。关键要点：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>食物网用连接度、链接密度、杂食性等参数量化群落的营养结构</li>\n<li>May 悖论表明非随机结构（弱联系、模块化）是大型食物网稳定存在的关键</li>\n<li>关键种和营养级联揭示了少数物种如何对整个群落产生不成比例的影响</li>\n<li>现代生态网络涵盖传粉、种子散布、寄生等多种互作类型</li>\n<li>嵌套性和模块化分别赋予网络对随机扰动的鲁棒性和对级联扰动的隔离能力</li>\n<li>食物网视角为预测生物多样性丧失的级联后果提供了定量工具</li>\n</ol>\n<p>食物网与生态网络的理论基础将在应用层面转化为保护决策——详见 <a href=\"../applied-ecology/conservation-biology\">保护生物学</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"食物网与生态网络","id":"食物网与生态网络"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从食物链到食物网","id":"从食物链到食物网"},{"level":2,"text":"食物网的拓扑结构","id":"食物网的拓扑结构"},{"level":3,"text":"基本网络参数","id":"基本网络参数"},{"level":3,"text":"营养位置","id":"营养位置"},{"level":3,"text":"食物网模式","id":"食物网模式"},{"level":2,"text":"食物网动态模型","id":"食物网动态模型"},{"level":3,"text":"Lotka-Volterra 系统","id":"lotka-volterra-系统"},{"level":3,"text":"多样性-稳定性争论","id":"多样性-稳定性争论"},{"level":3,"text":"作用强度分布","id":"作用强度分布"},{"level":2,"text":"关键种与营养级联","id":"关键种与营养级联"},{"level":3,"text":"关键种概念","id":"关键种概念"},{"level":3,"text":"营养级联","id":"营养级联"},{"level":2,"text":"生态网络的扩展","id":"生态网络的扩展"},{"level":3,"text":"超越营养关系","id":"超越营养关系"},{"level":3,"text":"网络分析方法","id":"网络分析方法"},{"level":3,"text":"嵌套性与模块化","id":"嵌套性与模块化"},{"level":2,"text":"食物网与生态系统功能","id":"食物网与生态系统功能"},{"level":3,"text":"多营养级视角","id":"多营养级视角"},{"level":3,"text":"生物多样性丧失的级联效应","id":"生物多样性丧失的级联效应"},{"level":2,"text":"食物网的构建与验证","id":"食物网的构建与验证"},{"level":3,"text":"数据来源","id":"数据来源"},{"level":3,"text":"食物网模型","id":"食物网模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"群落演替与干扰动态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ecology/community-ecology/succession-disturbance"},"next":{"title":"保护生物学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ecology/applied-ecology/conservation-biology"}}